msgctxt "#30023"
msgid "Sets the mouse cursor speed multiplier when moving the cursor with the RetroPad left analog stick or D-Pad. The default value of '1.0' is optimised for games that have a native resolution of '320x200' or '320x240'. When running 'high definition' games with a resolution of '640x400' or '640x480', a Gamepad Cursor Speed of '2.0' is recommended."
